# A same-page anchor. It must be quoted: unquoted, D2 reads everything after
# the # as a comment and the fence fails to compile ("missing value after
# colon"). This pins the form D2-DIAGRAMS.md tells authors to write. The
# node is not called Steps: D2 reads that as its reserved `steps` keyword.
# icons: 1
Overview: Process overview {
  link: "#detailed-steps"
}
Detail: Detailed steps

Overview -> Detail
